Package: AnophelesEntoTrials
Title: Estimate the Impact of Malaria Vector Control Interventions Based on Entomological Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Myroslava", "Volosko", , "myroslava.volosko@swisstph.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The AnophelesEntoTrials R package provides a platform to estimate
    the impact of malaria vector control interventions based on entomological
    data using MCMC models. It supports fitting Bayesian models to
    Entomological Hut Trial (EHT) data to estimate intervention efficacy
    parameters including repellency, pre-prandial killing, and post-prandial
    killing.
